# `theory/` is generated: `build_theory.py --check` rebuilds every file in
# memory and compares it to disk byte for byte. A CRLF translation on checkout
# would make that comparison fail on any machine with core.autocrlf=true, and
# the failure would read as "somebody hand-edited a generated file" -- the one
# thing the check exists to catch, reported for the one reason that is not it.
#
# Same reasoning as engine-rig/.gitattributes, one arm along.
* text eol=lf
